  {
    "id": 2007004110010,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "プロデューサー、これっ、この手紙……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp1",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "idols",
    "charId": "1040070010",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200700411/2007004110010"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004110020,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "プロデューサーが書いたんでしょ……！？",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "bgm": "008",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700411/2007004110020"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、気付かれたかぁ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004110030,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "当たり前！\r\nこんなの書けるのプロデューサーしかいないじゃん……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700411/2007004110030"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004110040,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "ファンレターに自分からの手紙混ぜとくとか、\r\nキザにも程があるから……！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700411/2007004110040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "はは、それを言われると痛いなぁ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004110050,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "っていうか運任せすぎっ\r\n三峰が気付かなかったらどうするつもりで──",
    "charAnim1": "touch",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700411/2007004110050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "結華は、ファンレターをすごく大切にしてるからさ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "さっきは、気付かれたかぁとか言ったけど、\r\nきっと見つけてもらえると思ってたんだ",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004110060,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "っ……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700411/2007004110060"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "予想通りだったな\r\nちゃんと読んでくれてありがとう、結華",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004110070,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "ああもう……何その信頼……！",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700411/2007004110070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004110080,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "そもそも、手紙もらったの……三峰の方だから……！\r\nお礼とかそれ……こっちの台詞だし……！",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700411/2007004110080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そんなことはないさ",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "結華がスカウトを受けてくれたから、\r\n俺は結華とここまで一緒に頑張ることができたんだし",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "結華がレッスンもステージもいつも全力でいてくれたから、\r\n立派なアイドルを支える仕事ができたんだし",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "結華への感謝は、いくらしたってし足りないくらいだぞ？\r\n手紙にも書いただろ？",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──だからさ\r\n本当に、今までありがとうな",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004110090,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "～～～～っ！？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700411/2007004110090"
  },
  {
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_cry",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "se": "0242",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "y": 25,
      "scale": 1.1,
      "time": 400
    },
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 500
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004110100,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "──だっ……から……！\r\nプロデューサーは、もう……！",
    "charAnim1": "surp3",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700411/2007004110100"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004110110,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "三峰からお礼言うタイミング奪わないでってば、\r\nこのおバカっ",
    "charAnim1": "touch",
    "charAnim2": "face_anger",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700411/2007004110110"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004110120,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "そんなの三峰だってねぇ、\r\n三峰だって最初からずーっと感謝してるから！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700411/2007004110120"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004110130,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "プロデューサーがスカウトしてくれたから、\r\nアイドルにだってなれたんだし！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700411/2007004110130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004110140,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "プロデューサーが一緒に頑張ってくれるから、\r\nここまでやってこれたんだし！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700411/2007004110140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004110150,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "プロデューサーのためだったら、\r\nプロデューサーが応援してくれる私だったら──",
    "charAnim1": "touch",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700411/2007004110150"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004110160,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "今よりもっと進めるのかもしれないって、\r\nそのためだったらどんな努力でもしてみせるって──",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700411/2007004110160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004110170,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "そう思ってるっていうの！\r\nそこんとこちゃんとわかってる？",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700411/2007004110170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004110180,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "はぁっ……はぁっ……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700411/2007004110180"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──……！\r\nあ、熱い……な……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004110190,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "あー、違う……！\r\n……だから、その……ほらぁ……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "to",
      "y": -25,
      "scale": 1,
      "time": 400
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/200700411/2007004110190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004110200,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "──……",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700411/2007004110200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004110210,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "私の方こそ、ありがとう……プロデューサー……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700411/2007004110210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004110220,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "変な言い方になっちゃったけど、今のは……\r\nほんとに、私の気持ち……だから",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700411/2007004110220"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004110230,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "これからもプロデューサーと、アイドルやりたいって……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700411/2007004110230"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004110240,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "そういう……",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700411/2007004110240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "──！　結華……！",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、ああ……！\r\nこちらこそだよ結華、ありがとう……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004110250,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……っ、やめてよねー\r\nこれじゃ、ありがとう合戦になっちゃうじゃん……",
    "charAnim1": "surp3",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700411/2007004110250"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それでもいいよ、だってそれだけ嬉しいんだから",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004110260,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "っ、プロデューサーと話してると、\r\nほんっと恥ずかしくてどうにかなりそうな時ある……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_close",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700411/2007004110260"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004110270,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……だから、こんなことまで言うつもりなかったのに……",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700411/2007004110270"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……えーと、すまん……\r\nはしゃぎすぎたか……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004110280,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_anger_s",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700411/2007004110280"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004110290,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……別にー？\r\nＰたんが嬉しいって言ってくれるなら、それはそれで",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_serious",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700411/2007004110290"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004110300,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "言うつもりはなかったけど、もう言っちゃったんだし、\r\n結果オーライって感じ",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700411/2007004110300"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004110310,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "……だから、三峰の気持ち、\r\n受け取って、大事にしてくれたら嬉しいな",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700411/2007004110310"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004110320,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "今日は勢い任せになっちゃったけど──",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700411/2007004110320"
  },
  {
    "id": 2007004110330,
    "speaker": "結華",
    "text": "いつかはもっと、素直に言えるようになるからさ",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "yuika",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200700411/2007004110330"
  },
  {
    "label": "end",
    "textFrame": "off"
  }
